WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.998
"Follow me, Ringo!" Bot said.

2
00:00:07.999 --> 00:00:10.986
She rolled toward Mount Magma.

3
00:00:10.987 --> 00:00:15.311
She was following the bird prints.

4
00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:23.642
Ringo ran along behind her.

5
00:00:23.643 --> 00:00:27.883
Rumble! The volcano was getting louder.

6
00:00:27.884 --> 00:00:35.253
The air was getting darker.

7
00:00:35.254 --> 00:00:39.380
Ringo was huffing and puffing.

8
00:00:39.381 --> 00:00:42.549
He was getting tired.

9
00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:46.470
"Bot! Slow down!" Ringo cried.

10
00:00:46.471 --> 00:00:49.264
But Bot didn't answer.

11
00:00:49.265 --> 00:00:57.521
Ringo stopped and looked around.

12
00:00:57.522 --> 00:01:04.375
"Bot! Where are you?" Ringo called.

13
00:01:04.376 --> 00:01:08.130
Whoopa-tweet! Whoopa-tweet!

14
00:01:08.131 --> 00:01:17.947
"Bot, is that you?" Ringo yelled.

15
00:01:17.948 --> 00:01:22.498
Whoopa-tweet! Whoopa-tweet!

16
00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:31.046
He followed the sound of the whistling.

17
00:01:31.047 --> 00:01:35.784
Whoopa-tweet! Whoopa-tweet!

18
00:01:35.785 --> 00:01:41.178
Ringo saw Bot's light ahead.

19
00:01:41.179 --> 00:01:46.334
"Bot, why are you whistling?" Ringo asked.

20
00:01:46.335 --> 00:01:52.123
Just then he heard more whistles. "Huh?"

21
00:01:52.124 --> 00:01:55.774
Two big birds were coming toward them.

22
00:01:55.775 --> 00:01:59.038
"The clamor birds!" Ringo said.

23
00:01:59.039 --> 00:02:02.607
"Hey!" One bird sounded angry.

24
00:02:02.608 --> 00:02:06.975
"Your spaceship crashed into our boomberry tree!"

25
00:02:06.976 --> 00:02:10.305
"We're from Space Patrol," Ringo said.

26
00:02:10.306 --> 00:02:14.971
"We came to rescue you," Bot said.

27
00:02:14.972 --> 00:02:18.825
"Rescue us?" the other bird said.

28
00:02:18.826 --> 00:02:21.499
"From what?"

29
00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:24.677
"The volcano," Ringo said.

30
00:02:24.678 --> 00:02:31.767
"You need to leave before it explodes!"

31
00:02:31.768 --> 00:02:34.458
The two birds looked at each other.

32
00:02:34.459 --> 00:02:44.542
Then they burst out laughing.

